      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {解答 设} \\varphi(x) = \\int_{0}^{x} \\sqrt{1+t^{4}}\\,dt + \\int_{\\cos x}^{0} e^{-t^{2}}\\,dt \\text {在}\\left[0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right] \\text {连续}, \\\\ \\text {且} \\varphi(0) = \\int_{1}^{0} e^{-t^{2}}\\,dt &lt; 0 , \\varphi\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\sqrt{1+t^{4}}\\,dt , \\text {则} \\varphi(0)\\varphi\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) &lt; 0 , \\text {由零点定理}, \\\\ \\text {至少存在} \\xi \\in \\left(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right), \\text {使} \\varphi(\\xi) = 0 , \\text {而} \\varphi^{\\prime}(x) = \\sqrt{1+x^{4}} + e^{-\\cos^{2}x}\\sin x &gt; 0 , \\therefore \\varphi(x) \\\\ \\text {在}(-\\infty,+\\infty)\\text {内单调上升，故} \\xi \\text {是唯一}. \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {解答 设} \\varphi(x) = \\int_{0}^{x} \\sqrt{1+t^{4}}\\,dt + \\int_{\\cos x}^{0} e^{-t^{2}}\\,dt \\text {在}\\left[0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right] \\text {连续}, \\\\ \\text {且} \\varphi(0) = \\int_{1}^{0} e^{-t^{2}}\\,dt &lt; 0 , \\varphi\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\sqrt{1+t^{4}}\\,dt , \\text {则} \\varphi(0)\\varphi\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) &lt; 0 , \\text {由零点定理}, \\\\ \\text {至少存在} \\xi \\in \\left(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right), \\text {使} \\varphi(\\xi) = 0 , \\text {而} \\varphi^{\\prime}(x) = \\sqrt{1+x^{4}} + e^{-\\cos^{2}x}\\sin x &gt; 0 , \\therefore \\varphi(x) \\\\ \\text {在}(-\\infty,+\\infty)\\text {内单调上升，故} \\xi \\text {是唯一}. \\end{array}</div>"
